00:00:01,790 --> 00:00:10,440
Triangle

2
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:19,680
Let's observe triangle ABC together.

3
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:33,960
Base and height of triangle.

4
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:42,770
Observing triangle ABC has:

5
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,640
BC is base

6
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:59,080
AH is height corresponding to base BC.

7
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:10,120
Length of AH is height.

8
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:19,070
Area of triangle.

9
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,160
How to calculate area of triangle.

10
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:31,260
Let S be area.

11
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:39,340
a is base length of triangle.

12
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:46,250
Let h be height of triangle.

13
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,570
To calculate area of triangle

14
00:01:52,040 --> 00:02:09,120
take base length times height (same unit) then divide by 2.

15
00:02:10,890 --> 00:02:16,480
We have formula for calculating area of triangle is:

16
00:02:17,130 --> 00:02:26,040
S = (a x h) : 2

